## Описание CLI-команд `./run`

Usage: ./run <command> [args...]
Commands:
  analyze             Run static analysis
  archive             Archive MainApp as .xcarchive
  build               Build MainApp and ShareExtension (Release)
  bump-version        Bump version numbers via agvtool
  clean               Clean build artifacts
  comment-scan        Scan for TODO/FIXME/print/debugPrint
  deploy:adhoc        Ad-hoc TestFlight deploy
  deploy:appstore     Upload to App Store Connect
  deploy:internal     Internal TestFlight deploy
  deploy:simulator    Build MainApp for simulator
  deploy:testflight   Upload IPA to TestFlight via altool
  export-ipa          Export IPA from archive
  fmt                 Run SwiftFormat (format code)
  generate            Run SwiftGen and XcodeGen
  init                Install CLI tools
  lint                Run SwiftLint (lint code)
  logs                Stream MainApp logs
  notify              Send notifications (Slack, email)
  size-report         Check ShareExtension size
  check               Run all checks (clean, generate, comment-scan, fmt, lint, analyze, build, test)
  test <test_id>      Run a test by id (e.g. MainAppUnitTests/TestExample). Always uses All plan.
  help                Show this help